{"id":"c967fbc56540a813","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-universal-model.md","title":"df-universal-model","display":"df-universal-model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-universal-model","aliases":["16-df-universal-model","Universal syntactic model"],"display":"df-universal-model","depends_on":["[[16-df-dtt-model]]","[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16","formalization_scope":"Initial model in the strict category of the selected strong fragment"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-universal-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-universal-model</span><span>Universal syntactic model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"16eda75ae9b57089\" href=\"?note=16eda75ae9b57089\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model\">16-df-dtt-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4fdfa4186458cce8\" href=\"?note=4fdfa4186458cce8\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model-morphism\">16-df-dtt-model-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"formalization_scope","html":"Initial model in the strict category of the selected strong fragment"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16eda75ae9b57089\" href=\"?note=16eda75ae9b57089\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model\">16-df-dtt-model</a> 的有限强一阶展示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为候选模型记录。模型及严格态射分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16eda75ae9b57089\" href=\"?note=16eda75ae9b57089\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model\">16-df-dtt-model</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4fdfa4186458cce8\" href=\"?note=4fdfa4186458cce8\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model-morphism\">16-df-dtt-model-morphism</a> 的完整定义。模型量化为足够大的元理论宇宙中的类量化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"16eda75ae9b57089\" href=\"?note=16eda75ae9b57089\" title=\"16-df-dtt-model\">16-df-dtt-model</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalModel}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalModel}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为本文件定义的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalModel}_\\Sigma(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(U)\\ \\land\\\n(\\forall M)\\bigl(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow(\\exists!F)\\ \\mathsf{Strict}_\\Sigma(F;U,M)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalModel}_\\Sigma(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(U)\\ \\land\\\n(\\forall M)\\bigl(\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma(M)\\Longrightarrow(\\exists!F)\\ \\mathsf{Strict}_\\Sigma(F;U,M)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>通用在此精确表示严格模型范畴中的初始对象。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" href=\"?note=ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3\" title=\"16-thm-term-model-initial\">16-thm-term-model-initial</a> 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal T_\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足这个定义；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"78b06d051d0fb2fc\" href=\"?note=78b06d051d0fb2fc\" title=\"16-thm-dtt-completeness\">16-thm-dtt-completeness</a> 的反向证明还明确使用了句法商解释，不从抽象初始性单独臆造“有效即可推导”。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dtt-model","status":"resolved","id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-model-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"4fdfa4186458cce8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-model","status":"resolved","id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$ 为 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 的有限强一阶展示；$U$ 为候选模型记录。模型及严格态射分别使用 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 与 [[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]] 的完整定义。模型量化为足够大的元理论宇宙中的类量化。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-model","status":"resolved","id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$ 为 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 的有限强一阶展示；$U$ 为候选模型记录。模型及严格态射分别使用 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 与 [[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]] 的完整定义。模型量化为足够大的元理论宇宙中的类量化。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-model-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"4fdfa4186458cce8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTSig}(\\Sigma)$ 为 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 的有限强一阶展示；$U$ 为候选模型记录。模型及严格态射分别使用 [[16-df-dtt-model]] 与 [[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]] 的完整定义。模型量化为足够大的元理论宇宙中的类量化。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dtt-model","status":"resolved","id":"16eda75ae9b57089","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DTTModel}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[16-df-dtt-model]]；$\\mathrm{UniversalModel}_\\Sigma$ 为本文件定义的谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-term-model-initial","status":"resolved","id":"ae9fd3f9de3bf0f3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","loc